# i18n

- Detect locale with `pageLocale(Astro.currentLocale, Astro.url.pathname)` so `/ru` and `/en` stay translated even if `currentLocale` is unset.
- Paths: `locPath(locale, "/vor-ort")`. Never hardcode `/en/...` inside a view.
- Every string in `messages.ts` must exist for `de`, `ru`, and `en` with the same keys.
- New page: German `src/pages/foo.astro` plus `src/pages/en/foo.astro` and `src/pages/ru/foo.astro`, all importing the same view.
- Courses and jobs: German markdown in `src/content/`; translated titles/bodies go in `messages.ts` (`courses` / job copy), not extra markdown trees.
- Do not prefix the default locale. Do not invent `he/` pages.
